Wobblybulb
==========
Created by Luka Sladakovic / Spiraldiver
https://linktr.ee/Spiraldive
2026

Mandelbulb variant with sinusoidal wobble distortion.
WobbleAmp controls intensity, Freq controls wave frequency.
